<body>
    <h1>Multi-Firm User Discovery Harbourfront</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryHarbourfront-BusinessStructure">Bus=
iness Structure</h1>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;"><img class=3D"drawio-diagram-imag=
e" width=3D"468" style=3D"width:561px;max-width: 100%;" src=3D"5a8165cecce0=
6656ade139d62828018dd1704bf062a52fd6e139df52f610b04e" height=3D"292"></span=
></p>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryHarbourfront-FirmUsageToday">Firm Usage Tod=
ay</h1>
<p><br></p>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryHarbourfront-HistoricalFeedback&amp;Observa=
tions"><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Historical Feedback &amp; Obs=
ervations</span></h1>
<p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Here=E2=80=99s a list to start on=
 the pain points noted by Harbourfront:</span></p>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"f2037c79-8668-4b18-8f70-ab022e506ce9">Managing multiple u=
ser credentials =E2=80=93 biggest pain point=20
  <ul>
   <li data-uuid=3D"8729a1bd-df0f-4a7e-99bb-aaa22b968c99">Related: limitati=
ons on being able to perform searches across full book of business on these=
 dashboards and tools</li>
  </ul></li>
 <ul>
  <li data-uuid=3D"1298b83b-e954-4d71-9346-9369efad6821">Heavy impact on ba=
ckoffice teams that support activities across all acquired businesses (e.g.=
 Compliance, Accounting)</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"f4a6accc-36ae-4176-b7a5-cfa8ea77803b">Toggling between l=
ogins costs the users a lot of time day-to-day</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"ada7d3be-8fcd-40a4-b512-38ae7ba80bc8">Limitations on abi=
lity to search across full book of business on Accounts view</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"5add9312-3d4c-4ed3-9925-324cc13f59ce">Limitations on acc=
essing single dashboard view functions on Compass modules, tools &amp; lega=
cy functions and tools (Servicing, iMOST, transfer management, reorgs etc.)=
</li>
 </ul>
</ul>
<ul>
 <li data-uuid=3D"84050d48-dfd7-4736-b79f-e5a9695e5ff4">Limitations on data=
 joins (acknowledging that even with a Parent Firm concept in FUM, some of =
these may be insurmountable); while we were able to merge most data files p=
roduced and sent to SFTP, we were unable to merge:</li>
 <ul>
  <li data-uuid=3D"0bcf5ec7-a72b-4dc7-a58b-6783f49515ee">Web Panagon report=
s</li>
  <li data-uuid=3D"54d12ec8-1152-47dd-bd7b-9977eec53237">Self-serve reports=
 (e.g. Compass Data Exports Tool)</li>
 </ul>
</ul>
<p>Source: Janet Guo (email dated April 13, 2026)</p>
<p><br></p>
