   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Oct 2 2025</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NCS-14404</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>User Joana Gomes da Costa has two Compass profiles and one was disa=
ble. The user informed that she does not have access to Servicing. Can you =
please confirm if the iMOST credentials are connected to the appropriate pr=
ofile?</p>
     <p><br></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">April 4 2025</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NCS-12294</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Were trying to add these rep codes to paul.georgeopulus profile but=
 are getting the attached error.</p>
     <p>Note: The error was caused by the requestor asking for RR codes bel=
onging to firm ID CWPC be added to a profile set up in ROTH - this user now=
 has three separate id's.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<p><br></p>
<h1 id=3D"MultiFirmUserDiscoveryHarbourfront-EngagementFindings">Engagement=
 Findings</h1>
